  "full-article-text": "<p id=\"\">In order to use Instabridge, you will first need to add your Radix address to your Instapass account. If you haven’t made an Instapass account yet, you can learn how to do so <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/article/how-to-create-your-instapass-identity\">here</a>.&nbsp; You will need to add your Radix (“crypto address”) you want to associate with your account, in Instapass, rather than directly in Instabridge. You can add as many different Radix wallet addresses to your account as you want.</p><p id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Please be aware that Instabridge will automatically use your default Radix address, you can switch to any of your verified Radix addresses within Instabridge, if you want to add a new address though, you will need to do this through Instapass.</strong></p><p id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Your betanet address is no longer valid. Only add your mainnet Radix wallet address(es). Do NOT send tokens to your betanet wallet as they will not be recoverable.</strong></p><p id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Step 1:</strong> Click “Add address”.</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:1166px\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"fullwidth\" data-rt-max-width=\"1166px\"><div id=\"\"><img id=\"\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60540b6d30224a7cb015203a/69eb24609ce7fee93a6488c7_628d034617e5eec3f2ed841d_KM356u3NIxGlv4SKh6dDwIK2_ZnQ5oVrJaqP42_0BSo4aQYmvVkRTrUCycN-F_tY9a6FU9gS8PQCPm5DR7OjpiI2f0BjsP9UOS_sbBgAwKnrAoIPd5D56T_Dexz3eVkWHZZQlx7KnSeTZYJXXA.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div></figure><p id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Step 2: </strong>Select which type of wallet address you want to add.</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:769px\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"fullwidth\" data-rt-max-width=\"769px\"><div id=\"\"><img id=\"\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60540b6d30224a7cb015203a/69eb24609ce7fee93a6488cd_628d0346adfa9dfa0ac85259_mdKE_OES5uOL7-VFBBJC87uLLSRAWF0MyzGy8qUtym4VlfJyN-BZfC73NKp_SaAMDDwQZkwAebtMcDoYJ02WYWUfxLUBR-V05wWiG2WZeJnSbpyM5c245F749Yjj63F_y2sE2CRmA0PBJ07iLw.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div></figure><p id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Step 3: </strong>When adding a Radix wallet address, you will need to copy your address from the Radix wallet application and paste it into the box, before clicking “Add address”. <strong id=\"\">Your betanet address is no longer valid. Only add your mainnet Radix wallet address(es). Do NOT send tokens to your betanet wallet as they will not be recoverable.&nbsp;</strong></p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:1268px\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"fullwidth\" data-rt-max-width=\"1268px\"><div id=\"\"><img id=\"\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60540b6d30224a7cb015203a/69eb24629ce7fee93a6488f3_628d0346adfa9d0974c8525b_4mxqwzUD47L3mOTrb8CaX2mgiRcQK3dlXL3RzLM3_BP50S1s-QP-PAvp3AObbyNMCpchBppN1OENsHGcbrc9MB-WzDlFsVavZpYRQLNkcYs9btTtwyfGkdj_yS8u7q1tvj89f1hkpkjVIXTW6Q.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div></figure><p id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Step 4:</strong> You will then be sent a VERIFY token with a confirmation code. Open your Radix wallet, select “History”.</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:234px\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"fullwidth\" data-rt-max-width=\"234px\"><div id=\"\"><img id=\"\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60540b6d30224a7cb015203a/69eb24619ce7fee93a6488e9_6405e37f3834a09f7583afc6_mudYx17HDcyzAi2RPx1mRZ5VSslnmmmnYwelntyioMyqaDhTQbqRKrvfvAuAQYYlaOu8nWD5EXDpIL5zqsfSFrpc9aRlzWix6yoZaln_n3pXOqVmKsejA4auDByLdcco2a_lIqpsjHgJC3frOYMATm4.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div></figure><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:777px\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"fullwidth\" data-rt-max-width=\"777px\"><div id=\"\"><img id=\"\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60540b6d30224a7cb015203a/69eb24629ce7fee93a6488f0_6405e37f67ad0f3c68f777dc_a5C91IKi2UVqhnSPwu88phmgfGgOWHJ90QJH82IsCso6gKPu0Sfy5kzhtgJSAghA14wu0ioaIMxWr6Db-JGnR7QgKQ2HJUn--X7iVlD85z04pKS63bl1GO092BexXtTpfyinai0IOGoHnsxiDIiatmA.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div></figure><p id=\"\">You should see 1 VERI, click “Encrypted message, click to decrypt.” to reveal your verification code.&nbsp;</p><p id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Step 5:</strong> In Instapass click “Done” when you are ready to enter the verification code.</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:768px\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"fullwidth\" data-rt-max-width=\"768px\"><div id=\"\"><img id=\"\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60540b6d30224a7cb015203a/69eb24619ce7fee93a6488e6_628d0346c2887e1867836bef_9dYd334b-c39LckXXhDCgp1m56EQ16k6pN5U10bX4xmmogC0BAPvENTtvbKDtnAza01yYbtWHWO3-6y-T0eC8TwoNjAQkwQjzuJaeTH-7q9xOZXxlUWeRDPnCwz0akUtz04HZkTfTDfrSQH-eg.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div></figure><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-center\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"center\"><div id=\"\"><img id=\"\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60540b6d30224a7cb015203a/69eb24619ce7fee93a6488ed_628d03471c089d67463a3762_rITCLH0kTDePBWdBfpkUpKQ997tC3bJvZNQt-S9rEVei3R4htt5UcXOaNCKIEOOfIx4sQ5TPLmh5urkHxaVT619YJSMNLZ19_72f1vnA5ZmYYWNgvO1w0UZrAvyVxtxqkkKNiaETNh011C5OtQ.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div></figure><p id=\"\">Once you have verified your wallet address it will be associated with your Instapass ID.</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:764px\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"fullwidth\" data-rt-max-width=\"764px\"><div id=\"\"><img id=\"\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60540b6d30224a7cb015203a/69eb24629ce7fee93a6488f6_628d03476551a5347353c814_SraE8E0F5hWu3i9OG0swx78g4WfVb4uuFzcsfn5lJ--a6gX0CDC4VJ-m6zP8yAWrvclLUCk7nmPlaVeQeqOOPVSzDFveXEO6B6kKVRQxgXf19fARfF3qVmc0Vodoj8vLUkS3fSJL-CvUmFuNjA.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div></figure><p id=\"\"><strong id=\"\">Step 6: </strong>The first address you add will automatically be set to your default address, you can change this at any time by clicking Manage under addresses.</p><figure id=\"\" class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:1169px\" data-rt-type=\"image\" data-rt-align=\"fullwidth\" data-rt-max-width=\"1169px\"><div id=\"\"><img id=\"\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60540b6d30224a7cb015203a/69eb24609ce7fee93a6488d0_6405e2e02c84fe21ef8723dd_GlhT6tn4hXfYt0plUiFKjavZFod3SAz748DyjaIVc2zGcq35q5QmH7gILUXctvtg71qVIolbXXF3t002tOVsSTyLNeh50tGjBz0X-PvhzB2Cjq6VMl6yqgono-RxfMECpAG63k20JxDm7TdLOy_btg4.png\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" loading=\"auto\"></div></figure><p id=\"\">‍</p><p id=\"\">Now that your KYC is complete and your wallet addresses have been connected, you are ready to use <a id=\"\" href=\"http://www.instabridge.io\">Instabridge</a> to convert your eXRD to XRD. To find out how to use Instabridge, please see our <a id=\"\" href=\"https://learn.radixdlt.com/categories/instabridge-user-guide\">Instabridge user guides</a>.</p><p id=\"\">If you need any assistance please contact <a id=\"\" href=\"mailto:support@instapass.io\">support@instapass.io</a>.</p><p id=\"\"><br></p>",
